{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:244","content":{"id":244,"title":"35 免疫系统是怎样牢记敌人的","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b8d57d6-c5c6-43a7-b45b-92a09dfaf79b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记住旧对手，并保持鲜活记忆，是免疫系统的重要能力。人体有免疫记忆，对于遭受过的感染，免疫系统会记住，再次感染可迅速消灭。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e50b1fe8-5969-40f0-b189-b2e9b9c78a62","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以有些病小孩更致命，因为小孩没有免疫记忆，而成年人有免疫记忆，等到老去，记忆细胞无法工作后，老年阶段也更容易生病。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d370eecb-007c-42cc-995d-225414fc1920","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞被 T 细胞激活后，其中一部分会变成各种类型的记忆细胞，分为几类："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"4fc93520-9e3c-4ef3-8cfe-29925f18c362","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"909c27ca-68a8-4bf3-87e7-7adf4586b404","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08a83007-c921-4e0a-a894-4741985f7f19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"长寿命浆细胞，位于骨髓，能活很久，它可以持续的生成一定量的抗体，它保证体液中时刻都有特定的抗体，每一滴血液中都有  13 万亿抗体"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b9569e76-5b1c-45ff-9f03-8a49024b0131","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dca8310e-8757-446e-ad0f-a638460708eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记忆 B 细胞，位于淋巴结，静静扫描淋巴液，寻找抗原，一旦发现，就会迅速大量增殖，不用辅助性 T 细胞激活，这就是为什么能免疫病原体的原因，记忆 B 细胞可以直接活化"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"176a4b57-8f15-4361-a7f0-573af90223df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"活化后的 T 细胞也能生成记忆细胞，"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"04d9635c-100e-4bcb-8733-535071ce4cda","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"555a979c-b191-43e7-815d-eb6c62940b26","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6a92e6c-5124-4044-85dc-794818e7dc47","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"90% 的 T 细胞在作战完成后凋亡，剩下 10% 变成组织驻留记忆 T 细胞，一旦发现敌人就激活周围的免疫系统"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fe6c93c5-32be-41fd-af4c-1bb3628cf9e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e392cc97-18b0-47e4-bedd-71b3709c210f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"效应 T 细胞，常年在淋巴系统和血液系统巡逻，寻找抗原"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4deb0f4c-7909-4213-bc57-acdea410f97c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"19d4002e-f884-44df-b126-f2f427b4da88","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"中心记忆 T 细胞，驻扎淋巴结，什么都不做，只存储战斗记忆，一旦活化，可以快速生成发动攻击的效应 T 细胞"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b96ccdc-a4a6-4c86-8a02-dc1a54757b10","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"记忆细胞威力很强，再次感染相同病原体是，往往都注意不到。"}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"6d02da6a-13d3-490c-928e-8c9e72098294","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9119217f-bf23-4ef3-a2f9-9a9ba48cbb37","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"麻疹病毒会杀死记忆细胞，它的感染性非常强，比新冠病毒强的多，麻疹病毒最喜欢攻击 T 细胞和 B 细胞，特别是长寿命浆细胞、记忆 B 细胞和记忆 T 细胞。感染麻疹后，免疫系统就失去了曾经得过的疾病的免疫能力，还会清除因接种疫苗而获得的保护。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"35 免疫系统是怎样牢记敌人的","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:244","type":"doc","id":244}}],"prevPage":{"title":"34 关闭免疫应答","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:243","type":"doc","id":243}},"nextPage":{"title":"36 疫苗和人工免疫","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:245","type":"doc","id":245}},"createTime":1741823329068,"updateTime":1743303640528,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640528}}